                        "sense_id": "4b5035fe-5189-37f5-9f3d-9c4f3956484f",
                        "entry_id": "6922e843-4767-39f9-bf0d-6d0a3c79e088",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One of four children born at the same birth; a quadruplet."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete",
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b83a6ce-5af2-44a7-857e-e046b2ff147f",
                                "sense_id": "4b5035fe-5189-37f5-9f3d-9c4f3956484f",
                                "text": "Every 67th lying-in woman has twins, every 5333rd has trillings, and only every 150,000th has fourlings."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c68806da-de15-4199-8ad0-5aa5802aa82e",
                                "sense_id": "4b5035fe-5189-37f5-9f3d-9c4f3956484f",
                                "text": "this breed is prominent for its remarkable fecundity and yield of milk; as a rule, this goat litters once a year and drops 2 kids; occasionally trillings and fourlings."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1864c437-1edb-4669-b9bc-b212f6c1edf1",
                                "sense_id": "4b5035fe-5189-37f5-9f3d-9c4f3956484f",
                                "text": "If the two or the four first cells into which the animal ovum divides during the process of so-called cleavage be separated from one another, then each of these cells grows into a small but complete organism. Conversely, if two ova be caused to amalgamate with parallel axes, the result is a \"giant\". What is the meaning of this? It is, that the material which, if left undisturbed, would have grown into one, can grow into many-into twins or into fourlings. And similarly the material destined for many may furnish one only."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "620cd1bf-246d-3e74-af08-959c83c550f8",
                        "entry_id": "6922e843-4767-39f9-bf0d-6d0a3c79e088",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A compound or twin crystal consisting of four individuals."
                        ],
